Start with Amber Fort early in the morning to beat the crowds. City Palace and Hawa Mahal are close together, so do them on foot in one go.

India's GDP growth over the last 5 full financial years ran from a fall of 5.8% in FY 2020-21 to a high of 9.7% in FY 2021-22, then eased to about 6.5% in FY 2024-25. These are rounded figures from memory, and the government revises them, so check the latest official release if you need exact numbers.

